      en: ["The highest peak, Monte Calvo, stands at 1,056 meters above sea level.", "Gargano National Park was formally established in the year 1991.", "The Foresta Umbra was designated a UNESCO World Heritage site in 2017.", "The Sanctuary of Monte Sant'Angelo has been a pilgrimage site since 490 AD.", "Over 60 species of wild orchids are native to the Gargano peninsula.", "The coastline of the promontory spans approximately 140 kilometers."],
